<title>PHILIPPINES: Jollibee sets 8.0 centavos cash dividend.</title>
<headline>Jollibee sets 8.0 centavos cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fastfood chain Jollibee Foods Corp said on Tuesday it had declared an eight centavo cash dividend to shareholders as of May 14.</p>
<p>The company told the Philippine Stock Exchange the dividend was payable on June 5.</p>
<p>The company did not say for what period the dividend was being paid.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
